import fs from'node:fs/promises';import path from'node:path';import assert from'node:assert/strict';import{createHash}from'node:crypto';const here=import.meta.dirname,sha=b=>createHash('sha256').update(b).digest('hex'),b=await fs.readFile(path.join(here,'source/vscode.d.ts.snapshot')),lines=b.toString().split('\n'),ledger=JSON.parse(await fs.readFile(path.join(here,'candidate/contracts.json.snapshot'))),entries=[];
for(const name of['Position','Range','Selection']){const first=lines.findIndex(l=>l.includes('export class '+name)),last=lines.findIndex((l,i)=>i>first&&l==='\t}');assert(first>=0&&last>first);for(let i=first+1;i<last;i++){const m=/^\t\t(?:(readonly)\s+)?(\w+)(?:\??:|\()/.exec(lines[i]);if(!m)continue;const start=i;while(!/^\t\t[^\t].*;\s*$/.test(lines[i])){i++;assert(i<last);}const end=i,optional=lines.slice(start,end+1).flatMap((l,k)=>/^\t\t\t\w+\?:/.test(l)?[{line:start+k+1,text:l.trim()}]:[]),match=ledger.contracts.filter(r=>r.class===name&&r.member===m[2]&&r.declaration.startLine===start+1&&r.declaration.endLine===end+1);assert.equal(match.length,1);assert.equal(match[0].declaration.sha256,sha(b));assert.equal(match[0].nestedOptionFields.length,optional.length);entries.push({class:name,member:m[2],startLine:start+1,endLine:end+1,raw:lines.slice(start,end+1).join('\n'),readonly:Boolean(m[1]),optionalFields:optional,ledgerID:match[0].id});}}
assert.equal(entries.length,30);assert.deepEqual(Object.fromEntries(['Position','Range','Selection'].map(n=>[n,entries.filter(e=>e.class===n).length])),{Position:13,Range:12,Selection:5});assert.equal(entries.flatMap(e=>e.optionalFields).length,6);const inherited=entries.filter(e=>e.class==='Range'&&e.member!=='constructor'),names=[...new Set(inherited.map(e=>e.member))];assert.equal(inherited.length,10);assert.equal(names.length,9);assert.equal(ledger.selectionInheritedRangeContractEntries,10);assert.equal(ledger.selectionInheritedRangeDistinctNames,9);await fs.writeFile(path.join(here,'declaration-audit.json'),JSON.stringify({schema:'rea-editor-value-api-independent-declaration-audit/v1',source:'source/vscode.d.ts.snapshot',sha256:sha(b),release:ledger.release,commit:ledger.commit,directEntries:30,optionalFields:6,classes:{Position:13,Range:12,Selection:5},inheritedRangeNonConstructorEntries:10,inheritedDistinctNames:9,names,entries,censusMethod:'Owned line/span extraction of top-level declaration members followed by exact ledger span and optional-field comparison; source census, not semantic execution.',legacyHelpersOutsideDocumentedCount:true,wholeExtensionApiCoverage:false},null,2)+'\n',{flag:'wx'});console.log('DECLARATION_CENSUS 30+6 inherited10/names9');
